graph GENERAL_RECOVERY 1
entry GENERAL-RECOVERY-001

gate GENERAL-RECOVERY-001
context HANDOFF
question "Is each failure classified as an ordinary puzzle, soft review, hard stop, or true owner blocker?"
evidence failure,class,route
YES GENERAL-RECOVERY-002
NO GENERAL-SOFT-REVIEW
UNKNOWN GENERAL-UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-HARD-STOP
end

gate GENERAL-RECOVERY-002
context HANDOFF
question "When scope, intent, authority, or conditions changed, was the old goal closed and a replacement goal routed?"
evidence goal_change,reassessment,replacement
YES GENERAL-COMPLETE
NO GENERAL-HARD-STOP
UNKNOWN GENERAL-UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-HARD-STOP
end

terminal GENERAL-COMPLETE COMPLETE "Recovery and goal reassessment are explicit."
terminal GENERAL-HARD-STOP HARD_STOP "The changed condition requires a new goal or authority."
terminal GENERAL-SOFT-REVIEW SOFT_REVIEW "The recovery route needs campaign review."
terminal GENERAL-UNPROVEN UNPROVEN "Recovery behavior is not established."

